 no return. The problem is now identified, like an illness which is recognized. The problem can no longer be prevented.", "time": "33500", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn8le09ob02re2img03.jpg", "text": "Third is the Ongoing Crisis Stage. This is the stage of discouragement because solving the problem takes time. The results of the problem are seen clearly and it may seem there is no end in sight.", "time": "46000", "id": 4}, {"image": "engenn8le09ob02re2img03.jpg", "text": "Fourth is the Crisis Resolution Stage. This is the stage of recovery. As the problem is managed, hope returns. Although the crisis is resolved, careful watch is still important. One does not want the problem to return.", "time": "59000", "id": 5}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}